            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "You're talking like it was hell on earth out there, but you look perfectly fine to me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Or are you talking it up to get a pity bonus?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Well, it's not like you had to go out of your way to leave camp to pick us up. Who asked you to be such a worrywart?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "I don't give a shit about anyone. Quit projecting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "If W hadn't stayed behind to create an opening for us, none of us would've made it out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...When did it happen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Two hours ago, when our communications were cut off. The squad got ambushed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "W blew apart the ruins and gave us a chance to escape. He fought until the bitter end."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Poor guy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Yeah. If only he made it back to camp alive. His kill count was well past mine. He would've come out as top merc, easy."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Forget it, no point talking about that stuff now. At least he's earned his rest."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "With the enemy routed, we should probably bring him back?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Impossible. We can't risk exposing ourselves like that. Don't want to get caught out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Why would you even want to? Were you two that close? Nobody told me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "He had a bunch of loot on him. That's all I care about."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "It wasn't that much. Some of the other guys brought in bigger hauls."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "When the war ends, we can go back to the good old days."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...If the war ends."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Hmph..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "We can sit around and commiserate later. We'd better get out of here before sunset if we don't want to be the center of attention."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Head back to camp and muster the troops."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Hmm\u2014?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Is that an order, 'Second' Lieutenant Hoederer?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...We've lost contact with the other squads. As of right now, I'm your commanding officer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "We're the same rank."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "*Sigh*...."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...Ines, let's hurry back to the rendezvous point. Then we can contact the client again to renegotiate our deal."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "That's a suggestion, not an order. All right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Hmph..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "How much you think we can milk W's death for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "A lot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "He was a helluva merc. Everybody knew."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "At least... his death won't be in vain."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "In the end, did he leave anything\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "\u2014Shh!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Someone's coming. Three o'clock. Not one of ours."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
