    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "A Sarkaz...? One of the natives?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "No, wait... You have W's gun and knife in your hands..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Who the hell are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Not talking? Then, die."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Wait, hold up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "She followed us here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...You let her follow you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "We haven't exactly been dragging our feet, but she's kept up with us purely through her own skills, even after grabbing W's gear."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "She's an 'experienced' Sarkaz, and I may need a local guide when it's time to bounce."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "\u2014Are you insane? Isn't that all the more reason to kill her right here?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "If you want us all dead, you might as well just do it yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "I wouldn't dare."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "What if she's an assassin? What if she leads us straight into a trap?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "Did you forget how many people in Kazdel want your head?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Oh? How many?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...There's one right in front of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "You've got a huge bounty on your head. But for the time being, I'd rather it stay on your shoulders. Don't get too full of yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "I appreciate your diligence and frugality, but I'm not joking around either."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "She took the risk to pick up W's knife and gun, and had the stones to walk right up to us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "What are your Arts telling you? Is she hostile?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...No sane person would just take in a totally unknown Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Yeah, that's the difference between you and me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "On my way back, I gave her a whole bunch of openings, and she... threw little stones at me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "An interesting display of good will, wouldn't you agree?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052",
            "name2": "avg_npc_047",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "According to the old ways, we might want to give her a chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "This war has thinned out our ranks. We could recruit some more Sarkaz, just as mysterious as her, but I'd rather hand-pick someone myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "But, she's an outsider. Our ways don't apply to\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "\u2014You know what, forget it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "I'm leaving in ten minutes. I don't care how many come with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ines",
        "text": "But if you're gonna give me any more corpses to deal with, I don't care whose, you better make it quick."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_052"
        }
    },
