            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Heh. Quite the impatient one, aren't you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...All right, you. Listen carefully."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "You're holding our fallen comrade's relics there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "Put them down, and you can walk out of here alive. You'll have to find somewhere else to die, but at least you'll buy yourself some extra time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "This is your last chance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "Last... chance?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "...I don't think I ever had a choice. The second I turn around, you draw your blade and cut me down."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman",
        "text": "This whole time... your other hand has been on that hilt."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_047"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer",
        "text": "...Very good."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
